Model "Capture and Filter".

Camera is a physical object [role: container, name: camera0, type: video_capture].

Capture is a process [role: container_process, name: camera0_readandget, type: video_capture_readandget].
Capture affects Camera.
Capture yields Image.
Capture invokes Filter.

Edges is an object [role: value, value_kind: output, datatype: juiz.Image].

Filter is a process [role: process, name: cvt_color0, type: cv_cvt_color].
Filter yields Edges.
Filter requires Filter Code [arg: code, arg_index: 1, applied: "COLOR_BGR2GRAY"].
Filter requires Image [arg: img, arg_index: 0, connection: push].

Filter Code is an object [role: value, value_kind: input].

Image is an object [role: value, value_kind: output, datatype: juiz.Image].

Main Loop EC is an object [role: ec, name: main_loop_ec0, type: main_loop_ec, rate: 10].
Main Loop EC can be stopped or started.
State started of Main Loop EC is initial.

Main Loop EC Cycle is a process [role: ec_cycle].
Main Loop EC Cycle occurs if Main Loop EC is started, otherwise Main Loop EC Cycle is skipped.
Main Loop EC Cycle invokes Capture [order: 0].
Main Loop EC Cycle invokes itself.

Vision System is an object [role: system, name: vision].
Vision System consists of Camera.
Vision System consists of Main Loop EC.
Vision System exhibits Capture.
Vision System exhibits Filter.
